  unitName: Piercing Tazer
  unitId: 20564
  unitNumber: 853
  description: A wandering disciple with no real master. It is speculated that he
    had once sworn service to a certain god, but that god's name has been lost to
    history. There are also rumors which state that he inherited all of his powers
    from his former master, making his abilities equal to those of a high ranking
    god. Forever a free spirit, Tazer refused to take orders from the gods, always
    acting on his own accord. This caused many gods to view him as a threat to the
    stability of their practices. Nowadays Tazer's name can only be found in a handful
    of legends passed down through the ages.
  summonDesc: A Summoner, huh...?<br>I don't like this one bit.<br>Don't tell me
    what to do.
  fusionDesc: Stop telling me what to do.<br>I'll help you out,<br>but I'll do it
    my way.
